"[HEADER] Connection Infos",
"kill",
"Once everything is set up, a new 'Archipelago' window should appear in the top-left corner after clicking 'START GAME'.\n\nIn 'Slot Name', enter the name assigned to your YAML file.\n\nIn the 'Server' field, enter archipelago.gg.\n\nIn 'Port' enter the room's port. This is a 5-digit number that you can find on the website after creating a new room.\n\nThe 'Password' field is optional. If the host did not set one, leave it blank.\n\nFinally, you can start a new run and it should connect you!",
